# Fix Names in a Table

## Problem Summary
Write a query to format each user's name so that the first letter is uppercase and all remaining letters are lowercase, then sort the results by `user_id`.

## Solution

```sql
SELECT user_id,
    CONCAT(
        UPPER(SUBSTR(name, 1, 1)),
        LOWER(SUBSTR(name, 2))
    ) AS name
FROM users ORDER BY user_id ASC;
```sql
